OL,3,AGavin and Stacey co-stars support
OL,4,AStrictly debut, says Melanie Walters
OL,5,
OL,6,FActor Melanie Walters has said her
OL,7,FGavin and Stacey co-stars have been
OL,8,F"hugely supportive" of her Strictly
OL,9,FCome Dancing debut, with Joanna Page
OL,10,F"very excited" for her to take to the
OL,11,Fballroom floor.
OL,13,FThe screen and stage star, 64, best
OL,14,Fknown for playing Gwen West in the BBC
OL,15,Fcomedy, is partnered with professional
OL,16,FAljaz Skorjanec, 36, in the new series
OL,17,Fof the dance programme.
OL,19,FWalters said being paired with
OL,20,FSkorjanec was a "dream come true" after
OL,21,Fthe pair performed together for the
OL,22,Ffirst time at Saturday's launch show.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,171,160,200,105,0,100
